
How do I track my loyal customers? How do I reward them? How do I get new customers? 
Jellin is the all-in-one solution for customer loyalty and acquisition. 
With Jellin, you can easily create and manage loyalty programs, track customer behavior, and reward your most loyal customers. 
Whether you're a small business or a large enterprise, Jellin has the tools you need to succeed.

How can I mutliply my customers by working with other local businesses? 
Jellin's cross-promotion feature allows you to partner with other local businesses to offer joint promotions and rewards. 
This not only helps you reach new customers but also strengthens your local business community.
By collaborating with other businesses, you can create a network of rewards that benefits everyone involved.
With Jellin, you can easily set up cross-promotions and track their success, making it easier than ever to grow your customer base and increase loyalty.

How can I track my employees' performance and reward them for their hard work and check for possible areas of improvement?
Jellin's employee performance tracking feature allows you to monitor your staff's performance and reward them for their hard work. 
You can track transactions and progress, assign oversight and approvals to managers and also offer incentives to motivate your team.
With Jellin, you can easily manage employee performance and create a positive work environment that benefits both your staff and your business.

How can I create a seamless onboarding experience for my customers?
Jellin's phone/email only onboarding allows customers to join your loyalty program with just a phone number or email. 
This eliminates the need for forms and reduces friction, making it easier for customers to sign up. 
SMS and email work everywhere, so customers can join your program without needing to download an app. 
With Jellin, you can create a seamless onboarding experience that encourages more customers to join your loyalty program and start engaging with your business.

How can I track the success of my loyalty campaigns?
Jellin's campaign analytics provide real-time tracking of redemptions, engagement, and more, so you can prove the success of your campaigns to clients with data. 
With Jellin, you can easily monitor the performance of your loyalty campaigns and make data-driven decisions to optimize your marketing efforts. 
By tracking key metrics, you can identify what works and what doesn't, allowing you to refine your strategies and maximize the impact of your loyalty programs. 
With Jellin, you can take the guesswork out of your marketing and ensure that your loyalty campaigns are delivering the results you want.

I offer sosial marketing services to bususiness. How can I use Jellin to provide more value to my clients?
Jellin's all-in-one loyalty and acquisition platform allows you to offer your clients a comprehensive solution for customer engagement. 
By integrating Jellin into your social marketing services, you can help your clients create and manage loyalty programs, track customer behavior, and reward their most loyal customers.
Also, you can make the most of the networking features of Jellin by connecting your clients with other local businesses for cross-promotions. 
This not only helps your clients reach new customers but also strengthens their local business community.
With Jellin, you can provide your clients with a powerful tool to enhance their customer engagement and drive business growth, making your social marketing services even more valuable.      